('philips-avent-scy106-02', 'SCY106/02', 'Anti-Colic Bottle 330ml PK2 (SCY106/02)', 12615, NULL, 'https://www.philipsaventpakistan.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/SCY106-02-1.jpg', '[\"https://www.philipsaventpakistan.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/SCY106-02-1.jpg\",\"https://www.philipsaventpakistan.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/SCY106-02-2-300x214.jpg\"]', 'Feeding Bottles', 'Philips Avent', 'Philips Avent Anti-Colic feeding bottle designed with an anti-colic valve to help keep air away from baby\'s tummy during feeding, plus a textured teat that supports a secure latch and uninterrupted drinking. This 330ml bottle comes as a pack of 2. The wide-neck design keeps filling, assembly and cleaning straightforward. Model SCY106/02.', 0, '[]', 0, 0, 1, NULL, '[\"philips-avent\",\"feeding-bottles\",\"anti-colic\",\"bottle\",\"330ml\"]', 'https://www.philipsaventpakistan.com/?s=SCY106%2F02&post_type=product', NULL, '{\"id\":\"philips-avent-scy106-02\",\"sku\":\"SCY106/02\",\"name\":\"Anti-Colic Bottle 330ml PK2 (SCY106/02)\",\"price\":12615,\"compareAt\":null,\"image\":\"https://www.philipsaventpakistan.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/SCY106-02-1.jpg\",\"images\":[\"https://www.philipsaventpakistan.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/SCY106-02-1.jpg\",\"https://www.philipsaventpakistan.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/SCY106-02-2-300x214.jpg\"],\"category\":\"Feeding Bottles\",\"brand\":\"Philips Avent\",\"hasOptions\":false,\"rating\":0,\"reviews\":0,\"inStock\":true,\"tags\":[\"philips-avent\",\"feeding-bottles\",\"anti-colic\",\"bottle\",\"330ml\"],\"description\":\"Philips Avent Anti-Colic feeding bottle designed with an anti-colic valve to help keep air away from baby\'s tummy during feeding, plus a textured teat that supports a secure latch and uninterrupted drinking. This 330ml bottle comes as a pack of 2. The wide-neck design keeps filling, assembly and cleaning straightforward. Model SCY106/02.\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://www.philipsaventpakistan.com/?s=SCY106%2F02&post_ty