('kidilo-kd3-3', 'KD3-3', 'Kidilo KD3-3 Multi-Stage Foldable Baby High Chair with Removable Tray', 12000, 15000, 'assets/products/card/kidilo-kd3-3.webp', '[\"assets/products/card/kidilo-kd3-3.webp\",\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-kd3-3.webp\",\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-kd3-3-detail.webp\"]', 'High Chairs', 'Kidilo', 'The Kidilo KD3-3 Multi-Stage Foldable Baby High Chair offers safe, ergonomic, and hygienic dining for babies and toddlers (6m to 3y). Features a stable pyramid A-frame structure, 5-point safety harness, removable double dishwasher-safe dinner tray with cup holder, adjustable footrest, and anti-slip feet. One-click easy folding for slim freestanding storage. Available in Black, Grey, Green, and Beige.', 1, '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"values\":[\"Black\",\"Grey\",\"Green\",\"Beige\"]}]', 4.8, 12, 1, NULL, '[\"kidilo\",\"high-chairs\",\"kd3-3\",\"feeding-chair\",\"baby-highchair\",\"dining\"]', 'https://www.parentinghub.pk/shop?brand=Kidilo', NULL, '{\"id\":\"kidilo-kd3-3\",\"sku\":\"KD3-3\",\"name\":\"Kidilo KD3-3 Multi-Stage Foldable Baby High Chair with Removable Tray\",\"brand\":\"Kidilo\",\"category\":\"High Chairs\",\"price\":12000,\"compareAt\":15000,\"image\":\"assets/products/card/kidilo-kd3-3.webp\",\"images\":[\"assets/products/card/kidilo-kd3-3.webp\",\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-kd3-3.webp\",\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-kd3-3-detail.webp\"],\"inStock\":true,\"hasOptions\":true,\"options\":[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"values\":[\"Black\",\"Grey\",\"Green\",\"Beige\"]}],\"tags\":[\"kidilo\",\"high-chairs\",\"kd3-3\",\"feeding-chair\",\"baby-highchair\",\"dining\"],\"rating\":4.8,\"reviews\":12,\"description\":\"The Kidilo KD3-3 Multi-Stage Foldable Baby High Chair offers safe, ergonomic, and hygienic dining for babies and toddlers (6m to 3y). Features a stable pyramid A-frame structure, 5-point safety harness, removable double dishwasher-safe dinner tray with cup holder, adjustable footrest, and anti-slip feet. One-click easy folding for slim freestanding storage. Available in Black, Grey, Green, and Beige.\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://www.parentinghub.pk/shop?brand=Kidilo\",\"img\":\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-kd3-3.webp\",\"cat\":\"High Chairs\",\"old\":15000,\"desc\":\"The Kidilo KD3-3 Multi-Stage Foldable Baby High Chair offers safe, ergonomic, and hygienic dining for babies and toddlers (6m to 3y). Features a stable pyramid A-frame structure, 5-point safety harness, removable double dishwasher-safe dinner tray with cup holder, adjustable footrest, and anti-slip feet. One-click easy folding for slim freestanding storage. Available in Black, Grey, Green, and Beige.\"}'),
