squito net canopy, ultra-soft breathable mattress, plush interactive hanging toys, remote control, and a sturdy lightweight aviation alloy frame. Supports infants from birth up to 12 months. Available in Grey and Coffee.\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://www.parentinghub.pk/shop?brand=Kidilo\",\"img\":\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-b01.webp\"}'),
