ive plush toy bar. Sturdy curved aluminum base with non-slip grips. Available in Dark Grey, Light Grey, and Khaki.\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://www.parentinghub.pk/shop?brand=Kidilo\",\"img\":\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-e04d.webp\",\"cat\":\"Baby Swings & Bouncers\",\"old\":16500,\"desc\":\"The Kidilo E04D Leaf-Style Ergonomic Baby Bouncer Seat features a soothing side-to-side natural gliding sway motion. Designed with a spine-supporting ergonomic cocoon contour, premium skin-friendly breathable fabrics, 3-point padded safety harness, multiple gentle speed settings, calming melodies, and an interactive plush toy bar. Sturdy curved aluminum base with non-slip grips. Available in Dark Grey, Light Grey, and Khaki.\"}'),
