/kidilo/kidilo-rc002.webp\",\"cat\":\"Baby Swings & Bouncers\",\"old\":19500,\"desc\":\"The Kidilo RC002 Comfort Gliding Baby Rocker is an adaptable resting, playing, and soothing seat for newborns up to 15 kg. Features multi-position backrest recline, ultra-cushioned washable fabrics, removable interactive toy arch, and dual functionality for gentle manual rocking or secure stationary lock. Available in sophisticated Dark Grey.\"}'),
