('kidilo-g303', 'G303', 'Kidilo G303 Lightweight Newborn Carry Seat & Infant Car Cot', 7700, 9900, 'assets/products/card/kidilo-g303.webp', '[\"assets/products/card/kidilo-g303.webp\",\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-g303.webp\",\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-g303-detail.webp\"]', 'Car Seats & Carry Cots', 'Kidilo', 'The Kidilo G303 is an ultra-lightweight infant carry seat and car cot designed for convenient daily travel and hospital discharges. Features a deep protective contoured shell, multi-position aluminum carry handle, UV sun canopy, soft padded newborn insert, and swift-release harness. Easy to install and allows you to carry your sleeping baby undisturbed.', 1, '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"values\":[\"Black\",\"Mix Color\"]}]', 4.6, 10, 1, NULL, '[\"kidilo\",\"car-seats-carry-cots\",\"g303\",\"carry-seat\",\"infant-seat\"]', 'https://www.parentinghub.pk/shop?brand=Kidilo', NULL, '{\"id\":\"kidilo-g303\",\"sku\":\"G303\",\"name\":\"Kidilo G303 Lightweight Newborn Carry Seat & Infant Car Cot\",\"brand\":\"Kidilo\",\"category\":\"Car Seats & Carry Cots\",\"price\":7700,\"compareAt\":9900,\"image\":\"assets/products/card/kidilo-g303.webp\",\"images\":[\"assets/products/card/kidilo-g303.webp\",\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-g303.webp\",\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-g303-detail.webp\"],\"inStock\":true,\"hasOptions\":true,\"options\":[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"values\":[\"Black\",\"Mix Color\"]}],\"tags\":[\"kidilo\",\"car-seats-carry-cots\",\"g303\",\"carry-seat\",\"infant-seat\"],\"rating\":4.6,\"reviews\":10,\"description\":\"The Kidilo G303 is an ultra-lightweight infant carry seat and car cot designed for convenient daily travel and hospital discharges. Features a deep protective contoured shell, multi-position aluminum carry handle, UV sun canopy, soft padded newborn insert, and swift-release harness. Easy to install and allows you to carry your sleeping baby undisturbed.\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://www.parentinghub.pk/shop?brand=Kidilo\",\"img\":\"assets/products