('kidilo-rc001', 'RC001', 'Kidilo RC001 Premium Soothing Bassinet Seat & Baby Swing', 13200, 16500, 'assets/products/card/kidilo-rc001.webp', '[\"assets/products/card/kidilo-rc001.webp\",\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-rc001.webp\",\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-rc001-detail.webp\"]', 'Baby Swings & Bouncers', 'Kidilo', 'The Kidilo RC001 Premium Soothing Bassinet Seat provides an ergonomic cocoon for restless infants. Features deep plush head and neck support, multiple gentle swaying speeds, preloaded soothing nature sounds and lullabies, adjustable sunshade canopy with sensory toys, and a sturdy anti-tip circular base. Available in Khaki, Light Grey, and Dark Grey.', 1, '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"values\":[\"Khaki\",\"Light Grey\",\"Dark Grey\"]}]', 4.8, 14, 1, NULL, '[\"kidilo\",\"baby-swings-bouncers\",\"rc001\",\"bassinet-seat\",\"electric-swing\"]', 'https://www.parentinghub.pk/shop?brand=Kidilo', NULL, '{\"id\":\"kidilo-rc001\",\"sku\":\"RC001\",\"name\":\"Kidilo RC001 Premium Soothing Bassinet Seat & Baby Swing\",\"brand\":\"Kidilo\",\"category\":\"Baby Swings & Bouncers\",\"price\":13200,\"compareAt\":16500,\"image\":\"assets/products/card/kidilo-rc001.webp\",\"images\":[\"assets/products/card/kidilo-rc001.webp\",\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-rc001.webp\",\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-rc001-detail.webp\"],\"inStock\":true,\"hasOptions\":true,\"options\":[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"values\":[\"Khaki\",\"Light Grey\",\"Dark Grey\"]}],\"tags\":[\"kidilo\",\"baby-swings-bouncers\",\"rc001\",\"bassinet-seat\",\"electric-swing\"],\"rating\":4.8,\"reviews\":14,\"description\":\"The Kidilo RC001 Premium Soothing Bassinet Seat provides an ergonomic cocoon for restless infants. Features deep plush head and neck support, multiple gentle swaying speeds, preloaded soothing nature sounds and lullabies, adjustable sunshade canopy with sensory toys, and a sturdy anti-tip circular base. Available in Khaki, Light Grey, and Dark Grey.\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://www.parentinghub.pk