('kidilo-y12', 'Y12', 'Kidilo Y12 Multi-Functional Electric Bedside Crib & Auto Swing', 27500, 34000, 'assets/products/card/kidilo-y12.webp', '[\"assets/products/card/kidilo-y12.webp\",\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-y12.webp\",\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-y12-detail.webp\"]', 'Baby Swings & Bouncers', 'Kidilo', 'The Kidilo Y12 is an advanced smart bedside co-sleeper and automatic swing crib. Connects securely to the parents\' bed with an easy drop-down side barrier for nighttime feeding and bonding. Features motorized gentle rocking speeds, smart timer settings, Bluetooth sound connectivity, full mosquito net canopy, and an orthopedic breathable mattress. Supported by a heavy-duty reinforced steel frame. Available in Dark Grey and Khaki.', 1, '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"values\":[\"Dark Grey\",\"Khaki\"]}]', 4.9, 19, 1, NULL, '[\"kidilo\",\"baby-swings-bouncers\",\"y12\",\"bedside-crib\",\"electric-swing\",\"co-sleeper\"]', 'https://www.parentinghub.pk/shop?brand=Kidilo', NULL, '{\"id\":\"kidilo-y12\",\"sku\":\"Y12\",\"name\":\"Kidilo Y12 Multi-Functional Electric Bedside Crib & Auto Swing\",\"brand\":\"Kidilo\",\"category\":\"Baby Swings & Bouncers\",\"price\":27500,\"compareAt\":34000,\"image\":\"assets/products/card/kidilo-y12.webp\",\"images\":[\"assets/products/card/kidilo-y12.webp\",\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-y12.webp\",\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-y12-detail.webp\"],\"inStock\":true,\"hasOptions\":true,\"options\":[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"values\":[\"Dark Grey\",\"Khaki\"]}],\"tags\":[\"kidilo\",\"baby-swings-bouncers\",\"y12\",\"bedside-crib\",\"electric-swing\",\"co-sleeper\"],\"rating\":4.9,\"reviews\":19,\"description\":\"The Kidilo Y12 is an advanced smart bedside co-sleeper and automatic swing crib. Connects securely to the parents\' bed with an easy drop-down side barrier for nighttime feeding and bonding. Features motorized gentle rocking speeds, smart timer settings, Bluetooth sound connectivity, full mosquito net canopy, and an orthopedic breathable mattress. Supported by a heavy-duty reinforced steel frame. Available in Dark Grey and Khaki.\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://www.parentinghub.pk/shop?brand=Kidilo\",\"img\":\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-y12.webp\"}'),
('kidilo-g305', 'G305', 'Kidilo G305 Ergonomic Infant Safety Seat & Multi-Angle Carry Cot', 7450, 9500, 'assets/products/card/kidilo-g305.webp', '[\"assets/products/card/kidilo-g305.webp\",\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-g305.webp\",\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-g305-detail.webp\"]', 'Car Seats & Carry Cots', 'Kidilo', 'The Kidilo G305 Infant Safety Seat & Carry Cot delivers reliable safety and comfort for new arrivals. Built with an impact-absorbing shell, 4-position ergonomic carry handle, UV canopy, and soft removable newborn body insert. Compatible with car seat belts and doubles as a portable carry cot and soothing rocking chair. Available in Black, Grey, and Brown.', 1, '[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"values\":[\"Black\",\"Grey\",\"Brown\"]}]', 4.7, 12, 1, NULL, '[\"kidilo\",\"car-seats-carry-cots\",\"g305\",\"carry-seat\",\"car-seat\",\"infant-cot\"]', 'https://www.parentinghub.pk/shop?brand=Kidilo', NULL, '{\"id\":\"kidilo-g305\",\"sku\":\"G305\",\"name\":\"Kidilo G305 Ergonomic Infant Safety Seat & Multi-Angle Carry Cot\",\"brand\":\"Kidilo\",\"category\":\"Car Seats & Carry Cots\",\"price\":7450,\"compareAt\":9500,\"image\":\"assets/products/card/kidilo-g305.webp\",\"images\":[\"assets/products/card/kidilo-g305.webp\",\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-g305.webp\",\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-g305-detail.webp\"],\"inStock\":true,\"hasOptions\":true,\"options\":[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"values\":[\"Black\",\"Grey\",\"Brown\"]}],\"tags\":[\"kidilo\",\"car-seats-carry-cots\",\"g305\",\"carry-seat\",\"car-seat\",\"infant-cot\"],\"rating\":4.7,\"reviews\":12,\"description\":\"The Kidilo G305 Infant Safety Seat & Carry Cot delivers reliable safety and comfort for new arrivals. Built with an impact-absorbing shell, 4-position ergonomic carry handle, UV canopy, and soft removable newborn body insert. Compatible with car seat belts and doubles as a portable carry cot and soothing rocking chair. Available in Black, Grey, and Brown.\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://www.parentinghub.