atures a gentle rocking arc, multi-position reclining mechanism, ergonomic padded nest with head support, secure 3-point harness, and removable activity toy bar. Lightweight and easily portable between rooms. Available in Khaki, Light Grey, and Dark Grey.\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://www.parentinghub.pk/shop?brand=Kidilo\",\"img\":\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-rc003.webp\",\"cat\":\"Baby Swings & Bouncers\",\"old\":18000,\"desc\":\"The Kidilo RC003 Deluxe Baby Rocker Seat delivers soothing motion and comfortable rest for your little one. Features a gentle rocking arc, multi-position reclining mechanism, ergonomic padded nest with head support, secure 3-point harness, and removable activity toy bar. Lightweight and easily portable between rooms. Available in Khaki, Light Grey, and Dark Grey.\"},{\"id\":\"kidilo-6018\",\"sku\":\"6018\",\"name\":\"Kidilo 6018 Foldable Baby Bath Tub Station with Elevated Stand\",\"brand\":\"Kidilo\",\"category\":\"Baby Bath & Care\",\"price\":19800,\"compareAt\":24500,\"image\":\"assets/products/card/kidilo-6018.webp\",\"images\":[\"assets/products/card/kidilo-6018.webp\",\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-6018.webp\",\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-6018-detail.webp\"],\"inStock\":true,\"hasOptions\":true,\"options\":[{\"name\":\"Color\",\"values\":[\"Dark Grey\"]}],\"tags\":[\"kidilo\",\"bath-care\",\"6018\",\"bath-tub\",\"baby-bath-station\",\"foldable-tub\"],\"rating\":4.9,\"reviews\":16,\"description\":\"The Kidilo 6018 Foldable Baby Bath Tub Station elevates infant bathing to waist height, eliminating parental backache and knee strain. Built with an ultra-sturdy reinforced steel frame, non-toxic BPA-free folding bathtub, rapid-drain hose, newborn anti-slip support cushion, and spacious bottom storage rack for towels, soaps, and bath essentials. Folds slim for compact storage. Available in sleek Dark Grey.\",\"sourceUrl\":\"https://www.parentinghub.pk/shop?brand=Kidilo\",\"img\":\"assets/products/kidilo/kidilo-6018.webp\"},{\"id\":\"kid